{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1777380535,"nonce":"CgZkz1G0z1pksme1OPqb9HoOzPA=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABAuDRRg","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/96","origin":"github"},"title":"BizzyBoat-specific nav2 params override (decouple from seafloor echoboat defaults)","message":"## Summary\n\nAdd a BizzyBoat-specific override for nav2 params so the BizzyBoat and seafloor echoboat platforms can diverge.\n\n## Motivation\n\n[`seafloor_echoboat_project11` PR #17](https://github.com/rolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11/pull/17) bumps `FollowPath default_speed` from 0.75 to 1.5 m/s in `echoboat_project11/config/nav2_params.yaml` — the file BizzyBoat currently inherits via `bizzyboat_project11/launch/nav_launch.py` → `echoboat_project11/launch/nav2_bringup_launch.py` (no params override).\n\nUntil BizzyBoat has its own override, **any nav-param change made for one platform implicitly applies to the other**. Today's bump was needed for BizzyBoat; the seafloor echoboat picked it up as a side effect.\n\n## Proposal\n\n- Add `bizzyboat_project11/config/nav2_params.yaml` (or similar) with BizzyBoat-specific overrides\n- Wire `bizzyboat_project11/launch/nav_launch.py` to pass it as a `params_file` override to `nav2_bringup_launch.py`\n- Document the layering in the launch file / docs so future params changes go to the right place\n\nDecide whether the override should:\n- (a) Fully duplicate the underlying params (simpler, but drifts over time)\n- (b) Only contain BizzyBoat-specific deltas (composes via nav2's `param_substitutions` or layered loading)\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Per-survey speed-specifyability (that's a separate gap in `unh_marine_navigation` BT → FollowPath integration — `target_speed` is extracted from the BT but never published to nav2's `/speed_limit`). Tracked separately from this issue.\n\n## References\n\n- Field-import PR that triggered this: [`seafloor_echoboat_project11` PR #17](https://github.com/rolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11/pull/17)\n- Field-import issue: [`seafloor_echoboat_project11` #16](https://github.com/rolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11/issues/16)\n- Deployment debrief: #94 (2026-04-27 deployment, gabby session)\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}